    &gt;💬 Discord&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;span&gt;  •  &lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://blog.khoj.dev&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;✍🏽 Blog&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://trendshift.io/repositories/10318&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://trendshift.io/api/badge/repositories/10318&#34; alt=&#34;khoj-ai%2Fkhoj | Trendshift&#34; style=&#34;width: 250px; height: 55px;&#34; width=&#34;250&#34; height=&#34;55&#34;/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;-new&#34;&gt;🎁 New
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Start any message with &lt;code&gt;/research&lt;/code&gt; to try out the experimental research mode with Khoj.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anyone can now &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://blog.khoj.dev/posts/create-agents-on-khoj/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;create custom agents&lt;/a&gt; with tunable personality, tools and knowledge bases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://blog.khoj.dev/posts/evaluate-khoj-quality/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Read&lt;/a&gt; about Khoj&amp;rsquo;s excellent performance on modern retrieval and reasoning benchmarks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;overview&#34;&gt;Overview
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://khoj.dev&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Khoj&lt;/a&gt; is a personal AI app to extend your capabilities. It smoothly scales up from an on-device personal AI to a cloud-scale enterprise AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Chat with any local or online LLM (e.g llama3, qwen, gemma, mistral, gpt, claude, gemini, deepseek).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get answers from the internet and your docs (including image, pdf, markdown, org-mode, word, notion files).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access it from your Browser, Obsidian, Emacs, Desktop, Phone or Whatsapp.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create agents with custom knowledge, persona, chat model and tools to take on any role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate away repetitive research. Get personal newsletters and smart notifications delivered to your inbox.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Find relevant docs quickly and easily using our advanced semantic search.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate images, talk out loud, play your messages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Khoj is open-source, self-hostable. Always.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run it privately on &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.khoj.dev/get-started/setup&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;your computer&lt;/a&gt; or try it on our &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://app.khoj.dev&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;cloud app&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;see-it-in-action&#34;&gt;See it in action
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://github.com/khoj-ai/khoj/blob/master/documentation/assets/img/quadratic_equation_khoj_web.gif?raw=true&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;demo_chat&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Go to &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://app.khoj.dev&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;https://app.khoj.dev&lt;/a&gt; to see Khoj live.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;full-feature-list&#34;&gt;Full feature list
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;You can see the full feature list &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.khoj.dev/category/features&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;self-host&#34;&gt;Self-Host
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;To get started with self-hosting Khoj, &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.khoj.dev/get-started/setup&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;read the docs&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;enterprise&#34;&gt;Enterprise
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Khoj is available as a cloud service, on-premises, or as a hybrid solution. To learn more about Khoj Enterprise, &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://khoj.dev/teams&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;visit our website&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;frequently-asked-questions-faq&#34;&gt;Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Q: Can I use Khoj without self-hosting?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Yes! You can use Khoj right away at &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://app.khoj.dev&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;https://app.khoj.dev&lt;/a&gt; — no setup required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Q: What kinds of documents can Khoj read?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Khoj supports a wide variety: PDFs, Markdown, Notion, Word docs, org-mode files, and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Q: How can I make my own agent?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check out &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://blog.khoj.dev/posts/create-agents-on-khoj/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;this blog post&lt;/a&gt; for a step-by-step guide to custom agents.
For more questions, head over to our &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://discord.gg/BDgyabRM6e&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Discord&lt;/a&gt;!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;contributors&#34;&gt;Contributors
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Cheers to our awesome contributors! 🎉&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/khoj-ai/khoj/graphs/contributors&#34;&gt;
