&lt;h3 id=&#34;interested-in-contributing&#34;&gt;Interested in Contributing?
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are always looking for contributors to help us build new features, improve the project documentation, or fix bugs. If you&amp;rsquo;re interested, please see our &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.khoj.dev/contributing/development&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Contributing Guidelines&lt;/a&gt; and check out our &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/orgs/khoj-ai/projects/4&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Contributors Project Board&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
